WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.720
Dr. Cleveland selected six drawings, depicting
the logos of the SCP Foundation, the Global

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:10.629
Occult Coalition; the Chaos Insurgency; the
Serpent's Hand; Marshall, Carter, and Dark,

00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:15.990
Ltd.; and Dr. Wondertainment, and prepared
them for testing with SCP-914.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.670
All of the drawings were placed into Clockworks
on the setting "Fine," and this was the output

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.670
produced:

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:25.619
"A comic scene, depicting the Avengers, the
X-Men, and the Guardians of the Galaxy fighting

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:26.619
in New York City.

00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:31.260
A flag, resembling the Nazi War flag with
the HYDRA symbol in place of the Swastika,

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.989
is seen from a distance.

00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:37.710
Several politicians, including Mayor Bill
de Blasio, are seen evacuating Manhattan,

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.210
as the Dark Phoenix is about to destroy it.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.879
Deadpool is also visible."

